    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through Poppy's dreams and realities to make friends or enemies. Help Poppy battle her inner demons in rhythm-based battles. Harmonize with the world to uncover the truth... or find what lurks in the darkest recesses of the mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of a rhythm game and a bullet hell </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the enemies or harmonize with them </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using the secrets hidden within the world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings and Paths </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-Style top-down RPG </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story rich game play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
